<h1 id=3D"EPSv6.10-Summary">Summary</h1>
<p>The EPS programme intends to introduce a new version of the interface re=
quirements. Planned changes include clarifications of some elements of v6.9=
 which are no longer applicable.</p>
<p><br></p>
